---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: 'https://aajkitazakhabar.pages.dev/en/' },
  { name: 'About Us', url: 'https://aajkitazakhabar.pages.dev/en/about' }
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us | Aaj Ki Taza Khabar"
  description="Discover the mission, verification standards, and bilingual architecture of Aaj Ki Taza Khabar, an independent digital newsroom."
  lang="en"
  canonicalUrl="https://aajkitazakhabar.pages.dev/en/about"
  alternateUrl="https://aajkitazakhabar.pages.dev/ur/about"
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-6 space-y-8">
    <header class="border-b border-neutral-800 pb-4">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-red-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Newsroom Identity</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white mt-1">About Aaj Ki Taza Khabar</h1>
      <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm mt-2">
        Independent, bilingual, multi-source verified digital journalism for Pakistan and global audiences.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-red max-w-none text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-sm sm:text-base">
      <p>
        <strong>Aaj Ki Taza Khabar (آج کی تازہ خبر)</strong> is an independent digital news organization established to counter the twin crises of online misinformation and sensationalized clickbait. Operating in both English and natural Urdu script, our mandate is simple: produce timely, concise, and rigorously verified news coverage that readers and search engines can trust implicitly.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-b border-neutral-800 pb-2">Our Core Principles</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc ps-5">
        <li>
          <strong>Zero Synthetic Inventions:</strong> We never invent news, quotes, numbers, sources, links, or outcomes. If a piece of information is unconfirmed by credible sources, we state clearly that it is not yet confirmed.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Multi-Source Corroboration:</strong> No event is reported on single-outlet hearsay. We require at least two distinct, reputable press reports or one direct primary authority (e.g., State Bank of Pakistan, Supreme Court, Pakistan Cricket Board, regulatory gazettes).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Editorial Dignity & Tone:</strong> We avoid sensationalist superlatives, unverified accusations against private individuals, and graphic content.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Bilingual Equity:</strong> Urdu is not treated as an afterthought or automated literal translation; our Urdu editions reflect natural, idiomatic newsroom prose in clean Nastaliq/Naskh typography.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-b border-neutral-800 pb-2">Quality Over Quantity</h2>
      <p>
        Unlike content mills that republish hundreds of uncurated wire snippets daily, Aaj Ki Taza Khabar limits publication to 10 to 20 carefully cross-checked, high-relevance developments per day. Every article undergoes automated multi-pass verification before human desk review.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-b border-neutral-800 pb-2">Institutional Independence</h2>
      <p>
        We are neither owned by nor affiliated with any political party, state intelligence entity, or commercial conglomerate. All editorial judgments are made strictly under our published editorial code of conduct.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
